    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμπτυκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>folded together, trussed
			up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				90
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀνάπαιστοι</span>
			<i>folded</i> anapaestics, dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				79
			</span></i> (<i>spondaic</i> acc. to Sch.Metr.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				4
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαίσια ξύμπτυκτα</span> (perh.
				<i>dovetailed</i>) is the best reading (<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>) in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				800
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπηκτά</span> is v.l.).</div>
